• *Check Network Configuration*:
    ◦ Validate the network request causing `NetworkError` and ensure the server endpoint is reachable and configured correctly.
• *Verify Template Variable Mappings*:
    ◦ Double-check that all `template-tags` are correctly defined and populated in the query. Provide default values to prevent null issues.
• *Validate Query Logic*:
