If you need more detailed troubleshooting steps or query corrections, let me know!", "channel": "C069FF9Q57S", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1732658169.921129", "type": "message", "text": "Yeah that bug is being tested by [PERSON_NAME_0050] .. seems to work fine now .
